    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "1cd7ecd8e81023f56de3": "Shut inside this little house, I dream of joining the battles that rage outside the city walls. Still, duty compels me to share my knowledge with others who fight in my stead... for now.",
        "4aa9055f5e54a0816fe2": "My teachings would be too advanced for you at this stage. If you wish to learn more of potions, speak with Tel'Athir here instead.",
        "65f8c53ef58e6e324070": "You are beyond my limited abilities. Seek out the night elf Ainethil in the Craftsmen's Terrace of Darnassus. She can teach you more. I only wish that I could go with you.",
        "826ed8a8df658bcd1ca0": "Train me.",
        "f5a86375b5c5ddce53ef": "Listen carefully, $n, for I have much knowledge to impart."
      },
      "name": "Lilyssia Nightbreeze",
      "subName": "Expert Alchemist",
      "translationMetadata": {
